A core move of Mr. Karate’s defense-minded moveset, being fast, mashable, chainable, plus on block, and with Mr. Karate’s tall stature, a great hop check as well. 

On grounded hit, you can go into your Combination Attack, mash out a confirm into 236B, or cancel to DP brake to launch your opponent for a full combo, but if you’re close enough, you can chain a close B, pushing your damage from lights even further.
