|description=Every character can taunt by pressing A, B, and C together, but Mr. Karate's taunt actually serves a practical gameplay use. Taking its name and use from the ''Art of Fighting'' series, Razz will increase the opponent's REV Gauge by 17% when used. This can be used to force a high REV opponent into Overheat. Mr. Karate can generally find an opportunity to Razz his opponent after a Heavy Hien Shippuu Kyaku if he doesn't '''Dragon Burst''' it, though some opponents with fast, long range supers might be able to punish him in time.

