* Like the Ignition version, charging the Redline version will cause it to deal more damage and have increased durability. Each charged Redline Super Haou Shoukou Ken projectile negates all projectiles while clashing with other charged Redline projectiles (Kaiser Wave, Super Haou Shoukou Ken).
